PRIMARY PHENOTYPE CORRECTION

Across every audited 5:3 arm:

the frozen post-epoch-8 oscillator
contains zero opposing-majority entries.

There are zero direct
favored-to-adverse majority flips.

The residual phenotype is therefore:

favored majority
-> unresolved majority state
-> favored majority,

repeated across pulse cycles.

This does not alter
the preregistered A45 information-gain result.

A45 remains NOT QUALIFIED
under its frozen detector.

It does alter
the scientific interpretation
of what remains unsolved.

POST-BURST COMPOSITION

State categories:

FAVORED:
currently committed to the net-favored side.

ADVERSE:
currently committed to the opposing side.

U:
uncommitted.

H:
protected uncertainty phenotype.

F:
refractory debt,
FC + FS.

UNRESOLVED:
U + H + FC + FS.

